          "message": {
            "text": "The conformance oracle now asks the production resolver question, including the raw CSS family stack. Run 31547607541 proved the previous instrument's answer digest and all 378 mismatches were unchanged despite the standard-style implementation, exposing that this argument was absent; the follow-up Windows byte-00 run validates the corrected contract.",
            "markdown": "The conformance oracle now asks the production resolver question, including the raw CSS family stack. Run 31547607541 proved the previous instrument's answer digest and all 378 mismatches were unchanged despite the standard-style implementation, exposing that this argument was absent; the follow-up Windows byte-00 run validates the corrected contract."
